mbination Agreement (execution version) with earnout (up to 500,000 earnout shares)\n\n**Count: 9 M&A matters.**\n\nI excluded matters that merely mention earnouts in ancillary documents (credit agreements, diligence memos, engagement letters, R&W insurance policies, disclosure schedules), matters where the earnout was proposed but not accepted, matters that explicitly state \"no earnout,\" and advisory matters (tax/CFIUS/regulatory) that reference an earnout in a deal document held elsewhere but do not themselves hold the executed deal document.",
